00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:30.920
So if you're seeing clients for an hour,
but you, I'm sorry, for 45 minutes,

177
00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:35.599
but you're billing the hour and your notes
are not reflecting that, that could be a

178
00:09:35.599 --> 00:09:36.199
