00:13:48.900 --> 00:13:51.220
and truthful when you're doing your
documentation.

247
00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:57.849
Because sometimes with technology, the
insurance companies can see what's going

248
00:13:57.849 --> 00:13:58.300
on.

249
00:13:58.300 --> 00:13:59.640
They can reach out to your client.

250
00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:04.340
They do their own audits with clients to
see how we as providers are doing.

251
00:14:04.720 --> 00:14:08.880
So you just want to keep all of that in
mind.

252
00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:09.960
Oops.

253
00:14:11.800 --> 00:14:12.540
Oh, no.

254
00:14:12.900 --> 00:14:13.500
Is it working?

255
00:14:13.600 --> 00:14:14.200
Okay.

256
00:14:15.240 --> 00:14:22.200
So documentations that protects you is
very important for yourself and

257
00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:23.080
your practice.

258
00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:29.540
It's important to write with clarity,
transparency, and precision, not

259
00:14:29.540 --> 00:14:30.200
defensiveness.

260
00:14:30.900 --> 00:14:36.020
So you want to make sure that you are, now
that we have AI,

