00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:40.760
it makes it a lot more easier for us to
get notes, record notes.

262
00:14:40.760 --> 00:14:46.623
If you're using AI, you still need to make
sure that everything is accurate, it makes

263
00:14:46.623 --> 00:14:47.180
sense,

264
00:14:47.180 --> 00:14:51.660
it's relatable to your sessions because
sometimes computers can mess up things

265
00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:52.260
too.

266
00:14:52.380 --> 00:14:57.980
So don't just depend on AI but use AI at
your advantage too.

267
00:14:58.180 --> 00:15:01.140
So it's okay to use it but use it for your
advantage.

268
00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:08.300
And just make sure that everything is
clear, transparent, and accurate.

269
00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:13.660
Every note should justify why the
treatment is clinically necessary.

270
00:15:13.900 --> 00:15:19.140
So you need to include your treatment plan
