00:19:54.700 --> 00:19:57.460
So you should, along with the initial
assessment,

343
00:19:57.882 --> 00:20:04.762
and 90 days after that. And then you can
do a reevaluation every six months

344
00:20:04.762 --> 00:20:05.722
and or a year

345
00:20:07.182 --> 00:20:08.622
along with the CASE LOCUS.

346
00:20:09.142 --> 00:20:13.222
So if you are doing, or let's say if
you're Medicaid clients,

347
00:20:13.682 --> 00:20:17.782
then you definitely need to do your CASE
and LOCUS right after doing the initial

348
00:20:17.782 --> 00:20:18.382
assessment.

349
00:20:18.522 --> 00:20:21.813
You cannot bill those on the same day, by
the way, it needs to be done on a

