00:20:41.662 --> 00:20:46.082
those things. At one point,
UnitedHealthcare was making it mandatory.

358
00:20:46.082 --> 00:20:47.382
They since pushed back on

359
00:20:47.382 --> 00:20:53.377
and it's not mandatory, but you can still
