00:22:26.302 --> 00:22:31.182
of way to do your notes, it is okay, but
make sure you're putting everything in

386
00:22:31.182 --> 00:22:32.622
there that you need

387
00:22:32.622 --> 00:22:39.218
when insurance audits. So both formats are
equally compliant and audit proof when

388
00:22:39.218 --> 00:22:40.022
completed

389
00:22:40.122 --> 00:22:41.678
thoroughly and accurately.

390
00:22:41.678 --> 00:22:45.242
So you can choose between which one, and
again, you can do a free

