00:22:51.738 --> 00:22:55.182
included. So I hope you can see my

393
00:22:56.102 --> 00:23:01.262
mouse. But in your note template, you must
have the client's name,

394
00:23:02.422 --> 00:23:08.402
their date of birth, date of service,
