00:23:17.762 --> 00:23:23.258
check your EHR because I noticed in Jane,
it doesn't auto-populate everything.

399
00:23:23.258 --> 00:23:24.162
So make sure

400
00:23:24.562 --> 00:23:30.062
that yours do. It also needs to have in
there the CPT code.

401
00:23:30.062 --> 00:23:32.702
So if your note template or your

