00:24:33.202 --> 00:24:37.942
a homework. But at the bottom, I couldn't
put it in this note template, at the

422
00:24:37.942 --> 00:24:38.462
bottom,

423
00:24:38.462 --> 00:24:39.942
or you could put it in your plan.

424
00:24:41.582 --> 00:24:44.162
No, let's just put it at the bottom, that

425
00:24:45.502 --> 00:24:48.121
including your treatment plan.

426
00:24:48.121 --> 00:24:53.022
So you can say, client continues to make
progress towards

427
00:24:53.022 --> 00:24:57.962
their treatment goal of X, Y, and Z,
whatever you have as a treatment goal.

428
00:24:58.282 --> 00:25:03.641
You can also put it in the assessment
section as well, but you just need to make

