00:25:14.242 --> 00:25:20.086
you need to make sure that is included in
your notes as well.

433
00:25:20.086 --> 00:25:22.442
I hope that makes sense.

434
00:25:25.302 --> 00:25:30.456
So the treatment plan is the roadmap for
care and key to audit defense,

435
00:25:30.456 --> 00:25:32.102
demonstrating clinical

436
00:25:32.102 --> 00:25:34.208
rationale and effectiveness.

437
00:25:34.208 --> 00:25:39.362
So it is so important to clearly justify
therapy based on the client's

438
00:25:39.522 --> 00:25:46.242
diagnosis. And so that is why I'm really
honing in and really emphasizing treatment

439
00:25:46.242 --> 00:25:47.442
plans. As much

440
00:25:47.722 --> 00:25:52.382
as we don't like, or maybe I'm speaking
