00:25:52.682 --> 00:25:58.082
you need to have a treatment plan because
it's just helpful with making sure that

443
00:25:58.082 --> 00:25:58.522
your client

444
00:25:58.522 --> 00:26:03.222
is on track, staying on track, you're
staying on track with the sessions, the

445
00:26:03.242 --> 00:26:04.422
goals, and you can see

446
00:26:04.422 --> 00:26:08.110
if they're making progress or how they're
making progress.

447
00:26:08.110 --> 00:26:10.422
So I'm probably going to say this to

448
00:26:12.762 --> 00:26:18.654
my lungs fall off, that you need to have a
treatment plan in place and you need to

449
00:26:18.654 --> 00:26:19.254
include

450
00:26:19.602 --> 00:26:24.122
it in your notes. So that way you can keep
track.

451
00:26:24.122 --> 00:26:27.482
So it's so important to have that based on
their

