00:26:41.762 --> 00:26:44.828
should include your client in the
treatment plan stage.

457
00:26:44.828 --> 00:26:47.182
So that way they know what they're working

458
00:26:47.282 --> 00:26:52.783
on as well. And you can use that in the
beginning, like the first session, or

459
00:26:52.783 --> 00:26:53.982
maybe the second

460
00:26:54.702 --> 00:26:58.542
