00:27:42.222 --> 00:27:46.062
make sure you're including that in the
treatment plan, because you're going to

476
00:27:46.062 --> 00:27:46.862
reflect that in your

477
00:27:46.862 --> 00:27:48.872
note, if that makes sense.

478
00:27:48.872 --> 00:27:54.082
So you're going to be saying that we
utilize client, or I should say,

479
00:27:54.722 --> 00:28:01.102
clinician and client utilize CBT to help
with reducing anxiety so that they

480
00:28:01.102 --> 00:28:04.482
